  "notes": "{果|は}たす means to fulfill, accomplish, or carry out something to completion. A somewhat formal verb used for duties, promises, and goals.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{果|は}たす\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{役割|やくわり}→役割：03638_yakuwari⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{果|は}たす: to fulfill a role\n- ⟦{約束|やくそく}→約束：01517_yakusoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{果|は}たす: to keep a promise\n- ⟦{責任|せきにん}→責任：03298_sekinin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{果|は}たす: to fulfill one's responsibility\n- ⟦{義務|ぎむ}→義務：02647_gimu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{果|は}たす: to carry out one's duty\n- ⟦{目的|もくてき}→目的：02433_mokuteki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{果|は}たす: to achieve one's purpose\n- ⟦{夢|ゆめ}→夢：01519_yume⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{果|は}たす: to realize one's dream\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{果|は}たして→果たして：13099_hatashite⟧: as expected; indeed; really (adverb — different usage)\n- ⟦{果|は}てる→果てる：28565_hateru⟧: to end, to be exhausted (intransitive)\n\nREGISTER:\nSlightly formal. Often used in written language, speeches, and news. In casual speech, ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ or ⟦やる→やる：02980_yaru⟧ may replace it.",
